{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636014142003740682","content":"A member of the Order of Kairo gets up to make an announcement that includes but is not limited to the following information. Upon their agreement, passage of 500 gold must be paid by the end of week one. Those who cannot or do not want to pay their own passage may have one of the four patron groups sponsor their place. Sponsorship comes with a form of employment. The patron may call upon that group of players from time to time to complete quests.\nA representative of each of the four patron groups will be available to take interviews and describe their beliefs and goals to their potential groups.","created_at":"2020-07-18T19:08:18.011000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-18T19:08:24.877000Z","id":"734124407043391558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
